flowchart TB
    Student[Student or allowlisted administrator] --> Web[React and Vite frontend]
    Web --> Firebase[Firebase Google authentication]
    Web -->|ID token, JSON, upload| API[FastAPI and Pydantic]
    API --> Auth[Firebase token verification and local revocation ledger]
    API --> Profile[UID-linked SQLite profile and theme]
    API --> Router[Hybrid intent and follow-up router]
    Router --> Greeting[Predefined conversation replies]
    Router --> Gemini[Gemini API with configured model]
    Router --> Retriever[Category-aware retrieval]
    Retriever --> Official[Official PDF text and local sparse SQLite index]
    Retriever --> Samples[Fictional sample policy files]
    Retriever --> Uploads[Admin-allowlisted local uploads]
    Gemini --> Verify[Structured output and exact-citation verification]
    Official --> Verify
    Samples --> Verify
    Uploads --> Verify
    Verify --> API
    API --> Web
    Prompts[V1, V2, V3 prompt files] --> Gemini
    Cases[18 test inputs] --> Runner[Backend evaluation runner]
    Runner --> Router
    Runner --> Exports[JSON, CSV, comparison log, frontend dashboard data]
    Pytest[Backend regression tests] --> API
